WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.459
Today we will use voice, space and roles to tell a story. Our work connects with our

00:00:05.459 --> 00:00:06.387
own local community.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.421
Assign a speaker, listener and narrator for a short scene.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:14.654
Practise lines with clear facial expression and turn-taking.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:18.499
Act the scene once and revise a confusing gesture.
